# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto
*.deb binary

# The tweak is compiled on macOS but developed on Windows, where git would otherwise
# check these out with CRLF. A line ending is whitespace to the preprocessor so it
# mostly survives — but a stray CR inside a Logos directive or a shader line has
# nowhere good to go, and the failure surfaces as a parse error far from its cause.
# Pin the files a compiler reads rather than a text editor.
*.m text eol=lf
*.h text eol=lf
*.x text eol=lf
*.metal text eol=lf
*.c text eol=lf
*.cpp text eol=lf
*.swift text eol=lf
*.y text eol=lf
*.l text eol=lf

# Build inputs that must not be touched at all.
Makefile text eol=lf
*.mk text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf